SUMMARY:Rainbows & Rescues Fundraiser for Hope Animal Rescue & EqualityNC
DESCRIPTION:One of our BEST annual events is back! We’ll be wrapping up national Pride month with the third edition of Rainbows & Rescues – a fundraiser benefitting Hope Animal Rescue and the good folks of EqualityNC. Join us on Sunday\, 6/28 from 12-3pm on the rooftop! Hope will be supplying adoptable pups\, activities\, and more. 10% of all-day sales will go to Hope\, and proceeds from all Jello shots will go to EqualityNC.
