SUMMARY:Bookmark Collage Party
DESCRIPTION:If your goal is to feel stronger in your body and mind\, join us and Beltane Strength & Fitness for a Bookmark Making Collage Party! It’s important to be tuned in to your own needs and goals – this is the perfect way to synthesize them into one powerful piece of art. Even better you get to do this with a nice ice cold bev beside you! \nPosters and some material will be provided\, but we are encouraging each person to bring:\n* a few magazines and/or newspaper\, old books\, stickers\n* their own cutting tool\n* glue \nBonus: This event takes place during our normal Craft Club hours. So if you don’t get a chance to finish or you wanna keep the fun going just come back next week. No sign up necessary. Grab a friend and join us! \nView on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/bookmark-collage-party/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Classes & Workshops
